<body>
    <h1>Send SMS</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"contentLayout2">
<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<p>The =E2=80=9CSend SMS=E2=80=9D panel is a feature that allows you to sen=
d an SMS message according to the settings that you put into place.</p><spa=
n class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence=
-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center=
" width=3D"297" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"1ac350771226a37093154a736711901e0c8=
e1b691de89e2ba3267755d0492b3a" data-image-src=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassia=
n.net/wiki/download/attachments/3424550925/Screenshot%202024-10-25%20at%202=
.08.31%E2%80%AFPM.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1729890527275&amp;=
cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"160" data-width=3D"543" data-=
unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4235919361" data-=
linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data=
-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Screenshot 2024-10-25 at 2.08.31=E2=80=AF=
PM.png" data-base-url=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-=
resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"34=
24550925" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"18" data-media-id=3D"2e=
15b2a2-c7c3-4bef-b65f-dc5549ba297b" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"87">=
</span>
<h3 id=3D"SendSMS-Configuration">Configuration</h3>
<p>To use this panel, you need to specify the following settings:</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout two-equal" data-layout=3D"two-equal">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Set as Flow Initiator</strong>: By selecting "Set as Flow Initia=
tor," this panel will serve as the starting point of the IVR flow, before p=
roceeding to subsequent panels within the Logic+ flow.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Panel Name</strong>: It is recommended that you choose a name an=
d keep it consistent. You will also need to specify the variable name to up=
date. If the variable does not exist, it will be created.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Panel Description</strong>: It is recommended to provide a clear=
 description of the panel, detailing its purpose and functionality. This is=
 akin to documentation, making it easier for others to understand and ident=
ify its intended use when they encounter it.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>To Number</strong>: This is the phone number where you want to s=
end the SMS message.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>From Number</strong>: This is the phone number of the sender, al=
so known as the caller ID.&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><em><strong>Use Dropdown:</strong></em> Select a phone number option fro=
m the dropdown menu.</p></li>
<li>
<p><em><strong>Use Variable:</strong></em> Enter a variable that contains a=
 phone number available for use in the Sharpen platform.</p></li>
</ol></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Content</strong>: This is the full text content of the SMS messa=
ge.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Exit Paths:</strong> Use the dropdown menu to select another pan=
el in your flow. Any output from this panel will advance to the linked pane=
l.</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Default:</strong> The Default path is taken upon panel execution=
.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Error: </strong>The path taken when there is an error</p></li>
</ol></li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<p></p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper=
 confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image i=
mage-center" width=3D"256" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"cc3764aa87ea7a4f71a7cca6=
7d70b8e940826a767b16d9303e701f6de260172d" data-image-src=3D"https://sharpen=
cx.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/3424550925/Screenshot%202024-10-=
29%20at%2010.09.47%E2%80%AFAM-20241029-171155.png?version=3D1&amp;modificat=
ionDate=3D1730222034661&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"6=
72" data-width=3D"256" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-reso=
urce-id=3D"4243456009" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resou=
rce-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Screenshot 20=
24-10-29 at 10.09.47=E2=80=AFAM-20241029-171155.png" data-base-url=3D"https=
://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image=
/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"3424550925" data-linked-resource=
-container-version=3D"18" data-media-id=3D"b9f764a8-0a89-420a-9119-7590110e=
de71" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"673"></span>
<p></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>The phone number specified in the =E2=80=9CFrom Number=E2=80=9D setting =
must be a number in Inbound Routes. If the =E2=80=9CFrom Number=E2=80=9D is=
 invalid, the Invalid Input exit path will be taken.</p>
</div>
</div>
<h3 id=3D"SendSMS-AdditionalInformation">Additional Information</h3>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>To create tailored SMS messages that apply directly to the recipient, us=
e interaction variables. This is especially helpful when the message conten=
t should be specific to each recipient, making the SMS message more persona=
l and engaging.</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Related Article: <a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/=
CT1/pages/4231364609/Available+Predefined+Variables" data-linked-resource-i=
d=3D"4231364609" data-linked-resource-version=3D"18" data-linked-resource-t=
ype=3D"page">Available Predefined Variables</a></p></li>
</ol></li>
<li>
<p>If the recipient replies to the SMS, the response will be sent back to t=
he specified From Number.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Agentless Article: <a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/space=
s/CT1/pages/2947743753/Creating+an+Agentless+Flow+as+Part+of+an+OmniOut+Cam=
paign" data-linked-resource-id=3D"2947743753" data-linked-resource-version=
=3D"15" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page">Creating an Agentless Flow as Pa=
rt of an OmniOut Campaign</a></p></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-not=
e">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>It's important to remember to follow all relevant laws and guidelines fo=
r SMS messaging. Failure to comply may result in SMS messaging being blocke=
d or disabled for the number.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
